ood documentary can sometimes feel like searching for a diamond in a sea of stones, especially when the trend seems to lean towards sensationalism rather than substance. I can imagine how frustrating it must be to be so passionate about music, only to feel misrepresented in these portrayals. Have you been involved in any online music communities lately? Engaging with others who share your interests can sometimes lead to discovering hidden gems that aren't mainstream but are infinitely more rewarding."
